==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|sjaután|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*sebuntehun}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''sautján''' 

# '''[[seventeen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[sextán#Icelandic|sextán]] and before [[átján#Icelandic|átján]].

